Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:01.22,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}次{\c}から次に襲い掛かる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.38,0:02:03.85,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}勘{\c}弁してよハプニング
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:06.69,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}だ{\c}がしかしまぁ　こんなところで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.57,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}負{\c}けない　私Lv.MAX
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:14.88,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}守{\c}りたい人場所があるから
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:17.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}強{\c}くなれる　超えて行ける
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:20.03,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}マ{\c}ジガチなんです
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.15,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}予{\c}測のできないこの運命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:25.78,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}良{\c}いとは言い切れないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:28.58,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}君{\c}と会えたこの人生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:31.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}だ{\c}けで勝ち組確定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:34.11,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}日{\c}が暮れても明けてても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.47,0:02:36.86,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}ど{\c}んな時も全力で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:39.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}笑{\c}って泣いてよく食べて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:42.30,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}困{\c}ったことは気にせずに
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:45.07,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}楽{\c}しんじゃってね　So☆Lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:25.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}無{\c}法預料的人生舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.74,0:01:28.46,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}或{\c}許稱不上萬事安泰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:31.03,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}遵{\c}循本心過個優哉游哉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:33.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}煩{\c}惱瑣事都不必放心懷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:36.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}邁{\c}步向前活出自己風采
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.99,0:01:50.74,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}不{\c}曾料想會被投身於此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.74,0:01:55.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}卻{\c}意外收穫隨心放縱日子 真Lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:58.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}但{\c}也別太鬆懈太大意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:01.22,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}麻{\c}煩一個接一個接踵而至
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.38,0:02:03.85,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}求{\c}求放過我吧Happening
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:06.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}不{\c}過也罷 即使這般境地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.57,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}也{\c}絕不能認輸 我可是Lv.MAX
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:14.88,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}正{\c}因有要守護的人與天地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:17.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}才{\c}能變得更強 跨過困難障壁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:20.03,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}動{\c}起真格來我豪不掩飾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}無{\c}法預料的命運安排
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:25.78,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}或{\c}許稱不上萬事安泰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:28.58,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}與{\c}你相遇的今生此趟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:31.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}便{\c}已讓我穩坐勝組人生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:34.11,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}無{\c}論夜幕降臨晨靄初開
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.47,0:02:36.86,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}任{\c}何時候都全力對待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:39.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}有{\c}哭有笑放開吃個自在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:42.30,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}煩{\c}惱瑣事都不必放心懷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:45.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{=5}{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}盡{\c}情享受吧 So☆Lucky
Comment: 0,0:21:40.56,0:21:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{=6}--------ED--------
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:55.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}念入りに書き込んだスケジュールも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:22:02.04,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今日は気分じゃなくて投げ出しました
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.51,0:22:06.42,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}大事な約束じゃなきゃたまには
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.85,0:22:12.35,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}行き当たりぱったりも　私っぽいや
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:17.41,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}相も変わらず毎日は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:20.60,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}慌ただしく続いて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:23.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}あれもこれも　予測できない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:27.26,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}こといっぱいで　退屈しないね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:30.99,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}さぁ　いっせーのせ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:34.58,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今日はどれにしようかな
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.84,0:22:38.04,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}私が選ぶ思いのまま
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:41.58,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}迷ったりして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:47.01,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}踏み出していくんだ　Brand-new way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:52.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}震えたのはなんだった?　なんだろうね?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.69,0:22:54.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}確かめにいこう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:56.19,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}Slowly step, glory days
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.19,0:22:59.18,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}So I'm fine today and tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.51,0:23:02.17,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}Let's go out for the weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:04.54,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}Eeny meeny miny moe
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:55.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}就算多嗎精心填好的日程表
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:22:02.04,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}都隨心情左右被拋向六點鐘方向
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.51,0:22:06.42,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}若非什麼至關重要的約定
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.85,0:22:12.35,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}偶爾心血來潮 也是我模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.85,0:22:17.41,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}日子依舊日復一日
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:20.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}匆匆忙忙停不下腳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:23.50,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}看看這 瞧瞧那 全都出乎意料
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:27.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}多彩的意外 根本不會感到無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:30.99,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}來呀 一二三四
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:34.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今天該選什麼好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.84,0:22:38.04,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}任性的指尖打著旋兒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:41.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}走呀 迷路彼方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:47.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}索性踏上嶄新的大道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:52.69,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}悸動的是心跳？還是預兆？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.69,0:22:54.08,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}去親眼確認就好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:56.19,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}慢步走 美好時光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.19,0:22:59.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今明往後 我亦無憂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.51,0:23:02.17,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}去漫遊 就在週末
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:04.54,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{=7}{\fad(200,200)\blur8}點指兵兵 人皆歡心

